--- !u!1001 &4037739196305745848
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 872902744695510833}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Years ago Lindon left his home as a powerless Unsouled. Now he goes
        to war with the most powerful beings in the world over the future of Cradle
        itself.  The Weeping Dragon has a grudge to settle and Lindon intends to
        take out the Dreadgod with his friends by his side. But rival Monarchs know
        his plans and they won't let things end so easily.  If Lindon does win he
        will ascend to the heavens. But he may not find a safe haven there either. 
        In the worlds above Suriel and Ozriel face off against the Mad King to determine
        the new shape of the cosmos. The victor will decide the fate of countless
        universes.  Whether he wins or dies Lindon will soon leave this life behind. 
        The time has come to say good-bye to Cradle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
