    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: As the Uncrowned King tournament reaches its final rounds tensions between
        the competing factions are higher than ever. The outcome may determine the
        power balance throughout the rest of the world.  Each Monarch schemes to
        seize any advantage they can...while far away a Dreadgod stirs.  When the
        tournament ends the Dreadgod will rise. Whether it will be driven back into
        the sea or allowed to rampage depends on the Monarchs.  And on which of them
        is left standing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
