--- !u!1001 &4866243757698079016
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 872902744695510833}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Advancing from zero to hero starts at zero.  Lindon is born Unsouled,
        the one person in his family unable to use the magical Paths of the sacred
        arts. He uses every trick and technique he can borrow or steal to improve
        his life, but it seems he will never be able to join the ranks of the truly
        powerful.  Until the heavens descend and show him the future.  When Lindon
        becomes the only one who sees the approaching doom, he must leave his homeland
        to save it... and to see how far he can go by walking his own Path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
