    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Long ago, the Monarch Northstrider created a world of his own.  This
        world, known as Ghostwater, housed some of his most valuable experiments.
        It has been damaged by the attack of the Bleeding Phoenix, and a team of
        Skysworn have been sent to recover whatever they can from the dying world. 
        Now, Lindon must brave the depths of this new dimension, scavenging treasures
        and pushing his skills to new heights to compete with new enemies.  Because
        Ghostwater is not as empty as it seems.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 368829892518402859, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
