    - target: {fileID: 1572844011559921090, guid: 3328e31852b13f442baec7aa9562cb29,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: book.bookDescription
      value: With his duel fast approaching, Lindon is locked away in prison.  As
        a Blackflame, he is too dangerous to remain free. The Skysworn, protectors
        of the Empire, have imprisoned him to keep him under control until the day
        of his promised fight arrives.  When it does, he will face Jai Long.  But
        a new danger approaches the Empire, closer every day. A legendary creature
        of impossible size and an endless thirst for blood. A Dreadgod.  Only the
        Skysworn stand between the people of the land and total annihilation.  And
        Lindon may be forced to join them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
